      "title": {
        "en": "Warm and caring salon team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently praise the family-run salon team for their friendly hospitality and personal dedication. Stylists such as Sonia, Ruby, Jasmine, and Jenna earn high marks for patient and attentive care. Reviewers especially value how comfortably staff welcome first-time clients and manage delicate grooming for senior dogs."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Cage-free comfort and gentle handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently appreciate the gentle, low-stress atmosphere created for pets. Owners highlight that dogs are not kept waiting in kennels during grooming appointments, which keeps them calm and content. Dogs routinely leave the salon relaxed and happy, with staff treating each animal like a member of their own family."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Flawless haircuts and fresh coats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report excellent grooming results, describing pets that return smelling wonderful, feeling soft, and sporting well-balanced haircuts. Clients commend stylists for careful de-matting work and even trims that maintain coat health. Many longtime patrons consider these haircuts among the best their dogs have ever received."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the salon keep dogs inside kennels during grooming?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "No, pet parents highlight that dogs are not kenneled during express grooming visits, creating a lower-stress environment."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are walk-in grooming services available?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients note that walk-in services like nail grinding for small dogs are handled promptly without prior booking."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does The Dog House offer boarding or daycare services?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the facility provides both doggy daycare and overnight boarding alongside its grooming services."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can the groomers handle senior dogs or matted fur?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers specifically praise stylists for patiently working with 16-year-old dogs and skillfully resolving heavy matting."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
